      "updated": 1791970502495,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Your game\nSteam link, game name\nor a short\ndescription, plus word\ncount and budget",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 88,
      "containerId": "s0",
      "originalText": "1. Your game\nSteam link, game name\nor a short\ndescription, plus word\ncount and budget",
      "lineHeight": 1.15
    },
    {
      "id": "ER1kiLWY0cRlW8rdIzXjE",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 314.0234375,
      "y": 169,
      "width": 144.953125,
      "height": 92,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 275411723,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1475499813,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791970502496,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. Games like yours\n3 well-known games\nwith similar Steam\ntags, each with real\nQloo fan data",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 88,
      "containerId": "s1",
      "originalText": "2. Games like yours\n3 well-known games\nwith similar Steam\ntags, each with real\nQloo fan data",
      "lineHeight": 1.15
    },
    {
      "id": "y5hqCmzJPF_RdEtCgMfur",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 554.12890625,
      "y": 178.2,
      "width": 162.7421875,
      "height": 73.6,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 408803755,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 138816133,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791970502498,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3. Where their fans are\nQloo's world fan maps\nof those games,\naveraged per country",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 69,
      "containerId": "s2",
      "originalText": "3. Where their fans are\nQloo's world fan maps\nof those games,\naveraged per country",
      "lineHeight": 1.15
    },
    {
      "id": "4EAVG9OkoOgNw9g3vSxlQ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 800.4375,
      "y": 169,
      "width": 168.125,
      "height": 92,
      "angle": 0,
